            "text": "Baseline precedence is segment metric, legacy element metric, then 0.85em only when neither exists. Unit coverage discriminates all three paths for mixed rotated/upright text and text-combine; the Chromium capture gate proves both segment shapes now receive a positive run ascent.",
            "markdown": "Baseline precedence is segment metric, legacy element metric, then 0.85em only when neither exists. Unit coverage discriminates all three paths for mixed rotated/upright text and text-combine; the Chromium capture gate proves both segment shapes now receive a positive run ascent."
          },
